WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:26.675
It was time for recess.

2
00:00:26.676 --> 00:00:33.865
Eddy drove onto the parking lot.

3
00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:37.640
"Hey, slowpoke!" Zippy yelled.

4
00:00:37.641 --> 00:00:40.372
Zippy took off.

5
00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.720
"Grr!" said Eddy.

6
00:00:43.721 --> 00:00:49.354
He raced after the bully.

7
00:00:49.355 --> 00:00:52.155
Poppy was waiting for Eddy.

8
00:00:52.156 --> 00:00:57.029
But Eddy didn't see her.

9
00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:05.809
Eddy chased Zippy around the racetrack.

10
00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:11.694
They went around and around.

11
00:01:11.695 --> 00:01:16.533
But Zippy was too fast.

12
00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:19.397
"Ha-ha!" said Zippy.

13
00:01:19.398 --> 00:01:24.391
"You're slow!"

14
00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:31.638
Zippy shot back to the parking lot.

15
00:01:31.639 --> 00:01:34.922
Eddy sighed.

16
00:01:34.923 --> 00:01:40.415
"Zippy is a show-off!" he said.

17
00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:45.641
Eddy drove back to school.

18
00:01:45.642 --> 00:01:50.853
He turned into the parking lot.

19
00:01:50.854 --> 00:01:54.244
"Hi, Poppy," said Eddy.

20
00:01:54.245 --> 00:01:57.338
Poppy glared at Eddy.

21
00:01:57.339 --> 00:02:01.345
"Don't say hi to me!" she snapped.

22
00:02:01.346 --> 00:02:09.983
"You forgot to help me!"
